 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 3.1,
   "end": 5.02,
   "text": "In your despair, you tug at one of the massive"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.06,
   "end": 8.32,
   "text": "wooden shelves to hurl the chemicals between you and Mylgor -"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.42,
   "end": 11.98,
   "text": "and it is easier than you expected: one short jerk,"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.06,
   "end": 14.642,
   "text": "and it topples over with everything on it!"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.393,
   "end": 20.581,
   "text": "\"Oh shit: Arnold!\", you think, completely amazed at your sudden strength,"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.616,
   "end": 23.527,
   "text": "as the shelf crashes to the floor and the contents"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.627,
   "end": 25.987,
   "text": "of the various bottles spill over the tiles."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.035,
   "end": 30.558,
   "text": "As two of the liquids mix, thick, acrid clouds of smoke rise,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.627,
   "end": 33.953,
   "text": "soon filling the whole room and making it almost"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.998,
   "end": 36.707,
   "text": "impossible for the two of you even to see each other!"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.347,
   "end": 39.61,
   "text": "A loud explosion knocks Mylgor off his"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.667,
   "end": 42.987,
   "text": "feet and hurls him brutally against the opposite wall,"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.027,
   "end": 46.387,
   "text": "and suddenly flames flicker up from the floor,"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.419,
   "end": 50.355,
   "text": "soon spreading and turning the room into a huge sea of fire!"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.507,
   "end": 52.627,
   "text": "Hot idea, man!"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.707,
   "end": 56.755,
   "text": "But now let's get out of here before it gets TOO hot...!"
  }
 ]
}
